bv.get_address_for_data_offset(OFF)   # map a file offset to a virtual address  @fileoffset @va @convert  <https://api.binary.ninja/binaryninja.binaryview-module.html#binaryninja.binaryview.BinaryView.get_address_for_data_offset>
